                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$ (Deterministic Polynomial Time). - **Asymptotic Bound:** $O(|B|)$ streaming write time per artifact ($``O(N_{\text{bytes}})``$ across $K$ artifacts with $``N_{\text{bytes}} = \sum_{k=1}^K |B_k|``$). Validation takes $O(|p|)$. Work-stealing scales as $``O(N_{\text{bytes}} / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + K)``$. Memory is $``B_{\text{max\_chunk}} = 64\text{ KB} \in O(1)``$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Bypasses NP-1 intervals (REQ-0117), NP-2 packing (REQ-0147), and NP-8 solving (REQ-0197). ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$ (Deterministic Polynomial Time). - **Asymptotic Bound:** Indexing takes $O(|S|)$. Coordinate lookup takes $O(\log M)$. Accumulation takes $O(1)$ amortized time, bounding collection to $O(|\mathcal{D}|)$ ($``|\mathcal{D}| \le K_{\text{max\_errors}}``$). Sorting takes $O(|\mathcal{D}| \log |\mathcal{D}|)$. Work-stealing across $``N_{\text{max\_workers}}``$ threads scales as $``O(|S| / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + |\mathcal{D}| \log |\mathcal{D}|)``$. Memory is $``O(M + K_{\text{max\_errors}})``$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Avoids NP-1 (REQ-0117), NP-2 (REQ-0147), NP-8 (REQ-0197). ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$ (Deterministic Polynomial Time). - **Asymptotic Bound:** $O(1)$ taxonomy range classification. Offset indexing requires $``O(|B_{\text{source}}|)``$; coordinate binary search requires $O(\log M)$. Deduplication sort in $``\mathcal{D}_{\text{sink}}``$ is $``O(C_{\text{max\_errors}} \log C_{\text{max\_errors}}) = O(1)``$. Work-stealing scales as $``O(|B_{\text{source}}| / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + 1)``$. Space is $``O(|B_{\text{source}}| + C_{\text{max\_errors}})``$ in arena storage. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Bypasses NP-1 intervals (REQ-0117) and NP-2 packing (REQ-0147). ---
