                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$. - **Asymptotic Bound:** $``O(|D_{\text{orig}}|)``$ non-destructive parsing and mutation time for document size $``|D_{\text{orig}}|``$. Block partitioning and prose hashing take $``O(|D_{\text{orig}}|)``$. AST mutation takes $``O(|\mathcal{B}_{\text{schema}}| + |\Delta_{\text{AST}}|)``$. Work-stealing scales as $``O(|D_{\text{orig}}| / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + \log N_{\text{max\_workers}})``$. Arena memory is $``O(|D_{\text{orig}}| + |\mathcal{B}|)``$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Bypasses NP-1 (REQ-0117), NP-2 (REQ-0147), and NP-8 (REQ-0197) via linear partitioning and in-place AST mutation. ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$ (Deterministic Polynomial Time). - **Asymptotic Bound:** $O(|V| + |E|)$ bijective tree isomorphism comparison ($``|V| = |\mathcal{V}_{\text{schema}}| + |\mathcal{V}_{\text{artifacts}}|``$, $``|E| = |\mathcal{E}_{\text{schema}}| + |\mathcal{E}_{\text{artifacts}}|``$). UUIDv5 hashing resolves node mapping in $O(1)$. Work-stealing scales as $``O((|V| + |E|) / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + \log N_{\text{max\_workers}})``$. Arena memory is $O(|V| + |E|)$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Pre-assigned UUIDv5 anchors collapse graph isomorphism to linear-time traversal, bypassing NP-1 intervals (REQ-0117) and NP-8 solving (REQ-0197). ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$ (Deterministic Polynomial Time). - **Asymptotic Bound:** $O(|A|)$ dispatch for tokens $|A|$, and $O(|S|)$ serialization for bytes $|S|$. Token lookup takes $O(1)$ time. Work-stealing incurs $``O(|U| / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + \log N_{\text{max\_workers}})``$ for $|U|$ units. Arena memory is $O(|A| + |S|)$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). CLI dispatch and serialization execute in linear time, bypassing NP-1 intervals (REQ-0117) and NP-8 SMT solving (REQ-0197). ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$. - **Asymptotic Bound:** $O(1)$ metric assertion. Compilation executes in $O(V + E)$ ($V \le 10{,}000, E \le 40{,}000$). Work-stealing scales as $``O((V + E)/N_{\text{max\_workers}} + T_\infty)``$ ($``T_\infty \le 8.0\text{ ms}``$). Memory is $O(V + E) \lt 100.0\text{ MB}$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Bounded unrolling (REQ-0124) and C3 linearization (REQ-0061) guarantee completion within 25.0 ms and 100.0 MB bounds, bypassing NP-1 (REQ-0117). ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** NP-complete (Decidable QF Fragments) / Undecidable (General First-Order Logic). - **Asymptotic Bound:** DPLL(T) search is bounded by cutoff $``O(\kappa_{\text{smt}} \cdot (C + A \log A))``$ for $C$ clauses and $A$ atoms. Theory solving runs in polynomial time. Work-stealing scales as $``O(\sum T_i / N_{\text{max\_workers}})``$. Arena footprint is $``O(V + E + \kappa_{\text{smt}})``$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** NP-8 (SMT Invariant Contract Satisfiability). Enforces quantifier-free fragments (`QF_LRA`, `QF_LIA`, `QF_UF`) and cutoff $``\kappa_{\text{smt}} \le 100{,}000``$, distinguishing NP-8 from NP-1 (REQ-0117). ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$ (Deterministic Polynomial Time). - **Asymptotic Bound:** $O(|M|)$ mutation generation for model size $|M|$; $O(N \log N)$ compilation and $O(N)$ invariant validation for $N$ nodes. Shrinking takes $O(N^2)$ candidate evaluations. Work-stealing scales as $``O(|M| / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + \log N_{\text{max\_workers}})``$. Arena memory is $O(|M| + N)$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Operates in polynomial time, bypassing NP-1 intervals (REQ-0117) and NP-8 solving (REQ-0197). ---
                      - **Complexity Class:** Class $\mathbf{P}$. - **Asymptotic Bound:** Verification executes in $O(|V| + |E| + |T|)$ time and space; sorting takes $O(|V| \log |V| + |E| \log |E|)$; work-stealing scales as $``O(N_{\text{total}} / N_{\text{max\_workers}} + \log N_{\text{max\_workers}})``$. - **Tractable Subclass and Frontier:** N/A (Deterministic P). Avoids NP-1 (REQ-0117) and NP-8 (REQ-0197). --- */
